  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth & GeoLite Audit - /auth",
      "description": "Endpoints de Autenticación y Auditoría Geográfica con MaxMind GeoLite2.\n\nPermite probar el registro, login exitoso y login fallido simulando diferentes direcciones IP mediante cabeceras `X-Forwarded-For` o `X-Real-IP` para verificar la resolución de País, Ciudad y ASN.\n\nVerificación manual:\n- En la consola de la aplicación (logs INFO/WARN formateados).\n- En la base de datos: `SELECT * FROM login_audits ORDER BY timestamp DESC;`",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Register User",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"santi\",\n  \"email\": \"santi@um.edu.ar\",\n  \"password\": \"Secreto123\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Santiago\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Lopez\",\n  \"phoneNumber\": \"+5492615551234\",\n  \"address\": \"Mendoza, Argentina\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Registra un nuevo usuario para poder realizar pruebas de autenticación y auditoría."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Login - Localhost / IP Local (Sin proxy)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code es 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"jwtToken\", json.token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"santi\",\n  \"password\": \"Secreto123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Login desde localhost sin cabeceras de proxy. Se audita como \"Local / Red Privada\" con código \"LOC\" y ciudad \"Localhost\"."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Login - IP Argentina (Simular Mendoza/BA)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
